{"video":"Tg_3i7xsFOE","lines":[{"t":[0,3.4],"en":"Okay, so now we draw cards."},{"t":[7.3,9],"en":"So, I wouldn't need any, right?"},{"t":[9.1,9.9],"en":"Because I have a straight."},{"t":[10.1,11],"en":"Oh, good for you!"},{"t":[15.4,17.1],"en":"Okay, Pheebs, how many do you want?"},{"t":[17.6,19.1],"en":"Okay, I just need two."},{"t":[19.6,21.6],"en":"The ten of spades and the six of clubs."},{"t":[24.2,26],"en":"No, Pheebs, you can't do that."},{"t":[26,27.5],"en":"Oh, wait, I have the ten of spades."},{"t":[27.6,28.1],"en":"Here, do you want them?"},{"t":[28.1,28.3],"en":"No, no."},{"t":[30,33.2],"en":"Uh, no, see, you can't do that."},{"t":[33.2,34.5],"en":"Oh, no, no, no, no, that's okay, that's okay."},{"t":[34.6,35.1],"en":"I don't need them."},{"t":[35.1,35.9],"en":"I'm going for fours."},{"t":[36,36.7],"en":"Oh, you're..."},{"t":[36.7,40.7],"en":"Damn it, damn it, damn it."},{"t":[41.4,43.6],"en":"I see, so then you were lying."},{"t":[44.2,44.8],"en":"About what?"},{"t":[45.1,46.3],"en":"About how good your cards were."},{"t":[46.8,48],"en":"I was bluffing."},{"t":[48.6,51],"en":"Aha, and what is bluffing?"},{"t":[53.2,55.6],"en":"Is it not another word for lying?"},{"t":[57,59.1],"en":"Okay, sorry to break up this party,"},{"t":[59.3,61.6],"en":"but I've got resumes to fax before work tomorrow."},{"t":[61.6,62],"en":"Ooh."},{"t":[62.5,63.4],"en":"Rachel, Rachel, we've got to settle."},{"t":[64,64.6],"en":"Settle what?"},{"t":[66.3,68.2],"en":"The Jamestown colony of Virginia."},{"t":[70.7,73.2],"en":"You see, King George is giving us the land, so..."},{"t":[73.2,78.4],"en":"The game, Rachel, the game."},{"t":[78.5,79.6],"en":"You owe us money for the game."},{"t":[80,80.8],"en":"Oh, right."},{"t":[81.1,82.1],"en":"You know what, you guys?"},{"t":[82.1,83.1],"en":"It's their first time."},{"t":[83.2,84.8],"en":"Why don't we just forget about the money?"},{"t":[85,86.5],"en":"No, no, we'll pay."},{"t":[87.5,89.7],"en":"Okay, Monica, I had another answer already."},{"t":[92.2,93.1],"en":"And you know what?"},{"t":[93.5,94.8],"en":"We want a rematch."},{"t":[95.2,96.2],"en":"Well, that's fine with me."},{"t":[96.6,97.4],"en":"Could use the money."},{"t":[98.4,99],"en":"All right."},{"t":[99.5,101.1],"en":"Your money's mine, Green."},{"t":[101.4,103],"en":"Your fly is open, Geller."},{"t":[108.9,110.5],"en":"You guys, you know what I just realized?"},{"t":[111.9,114.6],"en":"Joker is poker with a J."},{"t":[117.7,118.2],"en":"Coincidence?"},{"t":[120,120.9],"en":"Hey, that's..."},{"t":[120.9,123.1],"en":"That's Joe incidents with a C."},{"t":[134.4,135.2],"en":"Uh, Phoebe?"},{"t":[135.6,135.9],"en":"Phoebe?"},{"t":[136.3,137.2],"en":"Yeah, I'm out."},{"t":[138.7,139.2],"en":"I'm in."},{"t":[140,140.7],"en":"Me too."},{"t":[141.6,142.5],"en":"Me too."},{"t":[142.8,143.6],"en":"All right, what do you got?"},{"t":[144.5,146.1],"en":"Well, you better hop out of the shower,"},{"t":[146.4,148.2],"en":"because I got a flush."},{"t":[148.5,153.6],"en":"Well, well, well."},{"t":[153.8,156],"en":"Hop back in, bucko,"},{"t":[156.1,158.3],"en":"because I got four sixes!"},{"t":[158.6,159.8],"en":"I got four sixes!"},{"t":[159.8,160.2],"en":"I won!"},{"t":[160.8,161.7],"en":"I actually won!"},{"t":[162.1,163],"en":"Oh, my God!"},{"t":[163,163.8],"en":"You know what?"},{"t":[164,165.8],"en":"I think I'm going to make a little Ross pile."},{"t":[167.3,169.1],"en":"I think that one was Ross's,"},{"t":[169.2,171.2],"en":"and I think, oh, that one was Ross's."},{"t":[171.8,173.8],"en":"I see you're 20."},{"t":[175.7,176.6],"en":"Where's your 25?"},{"t":[178.5,184.2],"en":"I see you're 25."},{"t":[186,187.5],"en":"And, uh, Monica, get my purse."},{"t":[193.3,194.9],"en":"Rachel, there's nothing in it."},{"t":[197.1,198.6],"en":"Okay, then get me your purse."},{"t":[203.1,203.5],"en":"Okay, babe."},{"t":[204.5,205],"en":"Here you go."},{"t":[205.1,205.4],"en":"Good luck."},{"t":[206.3,207.1],"en":"Thank you."},{"t":[207.8,208.9],"en":"I saw you're 25,"},{"t":[209.4,210.5],"en":"and I raise you..."},{"t":[211.5,212.5],"en":"seven."},{"t":[214.6,215],"en":"Teen."},{"t":[223.9,225.3],"en":"Joey, I'm a little shy."},{"t":[226.4,228.1],"en":"That's okay, Ross."},{"t":[228.1,228.8],"en":"You can ask me."},{"t":[236.1,236.9],"en":"What do you need?"},{"t":[237,237.5],"en":"What do you need?"},{"t":[237.8,238.1],"en":"Fifteen."},{"t":[238.4,239],"en":"All right, here's ten."},{"t":[239.2,239.8],"en":"Here, I got five."},{"t":[239.8,240.2],"en":"I got five."},{"t":[240.5,241],"en":"Thank you."},{"t":[241.3,241.8],"en":"Good luck."},{"t":[243.5,245.7],"en":"Okay, I am calling your 17."},{"t":[245.7,247.1],"en":"What do you got?"},{"t":[247.9,259.6],"en":"Full house."},{"t":[269.2,269.9],"en":"You got him."},{"t":[270.4,272.1],"en":"No, no, no, no, no, no."},{"t":[281.8,282.3],"en":"That's all right."},{"t":[282.4,283.6],"en":"That's a tough hand to beat."},{"t":[283.7,284.6],"en":"I thought we had them."},{"t":[284.7,285.8],"en":"Oh, well, when you don't have the cards,"},{"t":[285.8,286.7],"en":"you don't have the cards, you know?"},{"t":[287.1,290],"en":"But, uh, look how happy she is."}]}
